2 CONT
2 CONT "George Jr., son of George (Georg) and Agnes (Ulmer) Spengler, was born 1480 A.D., and died in 1529. His brother, Lazarus Spengler, was noted in history as the coadjutor of Martin Luther. George Spengler, Jr., married Julianna Tuc
2 CONC herin in 1516, and of this union was born a son, Franz."
