1 NOTE {geni:about_me} WHO DID FRANTZ MARRY? Some researchers show Katherine (or Katherina) Futterer, some show Nancy Unknown, some don't list a spouse at all. I have found almost identical lists of children for Frantz & Nancy as I have 
2 CONC for Frantz and Katherine. I suspect that Frantz was married twice, but I don't have documentation on that. If he did marry twice, who was the mother of his children. I am leaning toward Katherine and will use her until I can anyth
2 CONC ing to support Nancy as mother. -- mez
