1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [1] http://www.gloggengiesser.dk/tng/getperson.php?personID=I2451&tree=PGL
2 CONT
2 CONT [2] https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/KHL3-MPY
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the sources Conrad II Glockengiesser Notzheimer was born about 1432. The name Gnotzhamer/Gnotzheimer/Notzheimer suggests that his mother was Ursula Notzheimer (not Agnes Scherp as in [1]). This raises the questions: <
2 CONC br/>
2 CONT (1) Is the birth date before the marriage of his parents (ca. 1434 after the death of Agnes Scherp in 1433) correct?<br/>
2 CONT (2) If born out-of-marriage in 1432 (which the surname of the mother suggests), is Hans Glockengiesser the biological father or did he adopt Conrad II?
