2 CONT Mother Ursula Glockengiesser seems to be stated incorrectly in gloggengiesser.dk due to the following inconsitencies:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Her aunt Dorothea writes a letter to her sister, the wife of Heinrich Voit in 1482; Ursula died in 1462
2 CONT * Anna Voit marries in 1492; Considering a marital age of about 20-25 years, she was approximately born in 1462 - 1467. Ursula died in 1462 and was married to Friedrich Herdegen at this time.
