2 CONT Mattäaus i. Welser was a Geheimrat, which was the title of the highest advising officials at the Imperial, royal or principal courts of the Holy Roman Empire, who jointly formed the Geheimer Rat reporting to the ruler. The English
2 CONC -language equivalent is Privy Councillor.
