1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT John Miller married Alice Lowe in 1529.  Grant King's document indicates that Alice was the "daughter of Nicholas and Alice Lowe of Bishops, Stratford, Herefordshire County."  It then goes on to say that the married couple moved t
2 CONC o London in 1539.  So nothing is said about where John Miller resided before moving to London.  But one might reasonably assume that it was somewhere in Herefordshire County.  At some point John Miller owned property in St. Albans
2 CONC    He was buried in St. Albans Parish on the 29th of December, 1558.
