2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes III Langenmantel zum Sparren, 1347 - 1426
2 CONT * Johannes III Langenmantel zum Sparren was born in 1347, at birth place , to Johannes II Langenmantel vom Sparen and Katharina Vögelin (born Vogelin) .
2 CONT * Johannes was born circa 1322, in Augsburg, Bayern, Deutschland.
2 CONT * Katharina was born in 1310, in Augsburg, Bavarian Swabia, Bavaria, Germany.
2 CONT * Johannes married Helena Langenmantel vom Sparren (born Rappolt) .
2 CONT * Helena was born in 1369, in Augsburg, Bayern, Deutschland.
2 CONT * They had 3 children: Leonhard Langenmantel zum Sparren and 2 other children .
2 CONT * Johannes then married Agnes Langenmantel zum Sparren (born Minner) .
2 CONT * Agnes was born in 1340, in Augsburg, Bajorország, Németország.
2 CONT * They had 2 children: Anna Roth von Schreckenstein (born Langenmantel vom Sparren) and one other child .
2 CONT * Johannes then married '''Ursula Rephuhn Langenmantel zum Sparren (born Langenmantel vom Sparren) .
2 CONT * '''Ursula was born circa 1355'''.'''
2 CONT * His occupation was occupation .
2 CONT * Johannes passed away in 1426, at age 79 at death place .
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * vor 1390.  Bei Wunder, Gerd: Die deutschen bürgerlichen Vorfahren des dänischen Thronfolgers heißt sie Ursula Rephuhn, in der AL Mörike dagegen Agnes Minner. AL Ludwig (DFA 116, S. 201) gibt an: Nach anderen Angaben heißt sie He
2 CONC lene Rappold. Hier nach Wunder u. AL Ludwig. (Agnes Minner ist die 1., Helene Rappold die 2. Frau ihres Schwiegervaters, so laut AL Ludwig, DFA 116). [nach Todt/Schweizer 2017]
