1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in Schoftland, Canton Berne (now Aargau), Swiss Confederation ( now Switzerland)
2 CONT
2 CONT Christening: 14 Sep., 1651 Schoftland, Canton Berne, Switzerland
2 CONT
2 CONT  Some of Hans issue stayed in Germany. Three left to survive them children with numerous descendants -- living in Weiler and Hilsbach.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Hans emigrated to "Weyler" (Weiler) under Steinsberg, near Sinsheim, on the Elsenz, Rhenish Palatinate, now in the Grand Duchy of Baden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: U.S. and International Marriage Records, 1560-1900
